In contest 1, if $L_1 \le X \le R_1$, rating becomes $X+1$. Else $X$.
In contest 2, if $L_2 \le \text{current\_rating} \le R_2$, rating becomes $\text{current\_rating}+1$. Else $\text{current\_rating}$.
And so on.

